e integration and restructuring cost was $156 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/livanova-plc-livn-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2018 Q3","e":"livn","d":"2018-10-31","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Frederick Wise","x":"Obviously, you raised the full-year guidance range.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/31/livanova-plc-livn-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2018 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2019-02-27","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"Firstly, anything that raises the awareness of drug resistant epilepsy is a good thing and again that's why we're leaning into the direct to consumer campaign, we think this is a large unmet need.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/livanova-plc-livn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2018 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2019-02-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"This increase is largely due to US investments in a DTC campaign for epilepsy, advanced circulatory support, commercial capabilities and strengthening our commercial organization in international markets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/livanova-plc-livn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2018 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2019-02-27","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"In Neuromodulation, we continue to see the increased demand for the SenTiva VNS Therapy System in the US and Europe, and should see the benefits of our DTC campaign begin to kick in.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/livanova-plc-livn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2018 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2019-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Cash flow from operations, excluding payments for one-time integration and restructuring cost was $217 million, up 39% versus prior year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/livanova-plc-livn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2018 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2019-02-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Our adjusted cash flow from operations for 2019 excluding integration, restructuring, product remediation and litigation payments is projected to be in the range of $180 million to $200 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/02/27/livanova-plc-livn-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2019-05-01","l":"streaming","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"…reason it's moved up is that we have made strategic investments in really neuromodulation, particularly, the direct-to-consumer promotion campaign as well as rest of world global expansion, as well as now we're bringing on TandemLife AGS to our portfolio and we doubled the sales force last year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/livanova-livn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2019-05-01","l":"dtc","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"The increase is largely due to U.S. investments in a DTC campaign for epilepsy, the full impact of including and expanding ACS commercial capabilities, strengthening our commercial organization in international markets and lower than expected overall sales results.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/livanova-livn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Cash flow from operations, excluding payments for onetime integration restructuring cost, was $30 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/livanova-livn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2019-05-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Our adjusted cash flow from operations for 2019, excluding integration, restructuring, product remediation and litigation payments is expected to be in a range of $150 million to $170 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/livanova-livn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2019-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"While we are lowering our guidance for 2019, we remain focused on investing in our highest growth opportunities to deliver long term growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/livanova-livn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2019-05-01","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Scott Bardo","x":"Clearly, not great to be cutting guidance only a few months after setting it.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/05/02/livanova-livn-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q2","e":"livn","d":"2019-07-31","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"But we have been seeing great progress on all fronts, both price/mix and operational efficiencies.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/livanova-plc-livn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q2","e":"livn","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Moving to cash flow, our cash flow from operations excluding payments for one-time integration and restructuring costs for the first half of 2019 was $38 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/livanova-plc-livn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q2","e":"livn","d":"2019-07-31","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"We continue to expand gross margins, make significant investments in our R&D portfolio while streamlining expenses in non-core areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/livanova-plc-livn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q2","e":"livn","d":"2019-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"Today, we will discuss our results, provide some recent highlights, and reaffirm guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/31/livanova-plc-livn-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q3","e":"livn","d":"2019-10-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"We typically have a price increase in the quarter where we selectively look at price changes by geography.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/livanova-plc-livn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q3","e":"livn","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Our cash flow from operations, excluding payments for onetime integration and restructuring costs through the third quarter of 2019, was $91 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/livanova-plc-livn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q3","e":"livn","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"We continue to expand gross margins, make significant investments in our R&D portfolio and streamline expenses in non-core areas.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/livanova-plc-livn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q3","e":"livn","d":"2019-10-30","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Raj Denhoy","x":"Just the -- so now you raised the guidance for the U.S., VNS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/31/livanova-plc-livn-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2020-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Our cash flow from operations, excluding payments for onetime integration restructuring costs through the fourth quarter of 2019, was $151 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/livanova-plc-livn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2019 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2020-02-26","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Our adjusted cash flow from operations, excluding integration, restructuring, 3T product remediation and litigation payments, is expected to be in the range of $180 million to $200 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/26/livanova-plc-livn-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2020 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Our cash flow from operations, excluding payments for onetime integration and restructuring costs, through the first quarter of 2020 was $25 million, compared to $24 million in the same quarter the previous year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/livanova-plc-livn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2020 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2020-04-29","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thad Huston","x":"Specifically, we've instituted a hiring freeze and are participating in government-sponsored work programs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/30/livanova-plc-livn-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"LIVN 2020 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"Specifically, these four key areas included the following: first, we instituted a hiring freeze, participated in government sponsored work programs and adjusted employee-related expenses, including lower performance-based compensation and a significant reduction in Executive Leadership short-term…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/livanova-plc-livn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2020 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2021-02-24","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Alex Shvartsburg","x":"Our free cash flow measure has essentially -- we stopped taking out a number of adjustments and really streamline it to a point where it's operating cash flows less investing activities and only adjusting for extraordinary items like the 3T settlements.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/24/livanova-plc-livn-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2021 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"Additionally, we continue to take actions to further streamline our business, lower costs and improve free cash flow.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/livanova-plc-livn-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2021 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2021-04-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"We had a couple of items, one, was the divestiture-related costs legal and advisory fees that we incurred in the first quarter and then some separation payments related to the organizational restructuring that we did in Q4, Q1.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/28/livanova-plc-livn-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2021 Q2","e":"livn","d":"2021-07-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Anthony Petrone","x":"Just sort of trying to work through that, how much of that was the revenue beat versus just cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/28/livanova-plc-livn-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2021 Q3","e":"livn","d":"2021-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"After my comments, Alex will provide you with additional details on our results and increased guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/livanova-plc-livn-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2021 Q3","e":"livn","d":"2021-11-03","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Damien McDonald","x":"We are building good momentum across a diverse portfolio and, taking this into consideration, we've increased our guidance ranges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/03/livanova-plc-livn-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2025 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2026-02-25","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alex Shvartsburg","x":"Favorable product mix and pricing across segments and geographies were offset by unfavorable currency changes and tariff impacts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/livanova-livn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2025 Q4","e":"livn","d":"2026-02-25","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ahmet Tezel","x":"The goal is to streamline workflows that include remote titration, provide immediate access to patient insight, and enable more digitally connected care pathways that remove barriers to access.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/25/livanova-livn-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2026 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alex Shvartsburg","x":"Consistent with our prior guidance, we estimate a tariff net impact of less than $5 million on adjusted operating income for the full year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/livanova-livn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2026 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alex Shvartsburg","x":"At this point, we are not assuming a tariff refund benefit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/livanova-livn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2026 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vladimir Makatsaria","x":"The performance was otherwise driven by underlying demand and the associated favorable price/mix effect.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/livanova-livn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2026 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vladimir Makatsaria","x":"As a result, we saw improved realized pricing in the first quarter, driven by less volume discounting as well as our normal annual list price increase.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/livanova-livn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2026 Q1","e":"livn","d":"2026-05-06","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Ahmet Tezel","x":"This multiyear innovation road map is expected to streamline care delivery through remote titration, real-time access to patient insights and more digitally connected care pathways that remove barriers to access.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/06/livanova-livn-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2026 Q2","e":"livn","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alex Shvartsburg","x":"In the quarter, we received a $6 million net tariff benefit from previously paid IEEPA tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/livanova-livn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2026 Q2","e":"livn","d":"2026-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Alex Shvartsburg","x":"The benefit from the tariff refund and improved pricing were partially offset by unfavorable currency.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/livanova-livn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2026 Q2","e":"livn","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Alex Shvartsburg","x":"As Vlad mentioned, our realized price, our normal inflationary price increase is 1% to 2% historically, we saw our realized price nearly double in the first half of the year, and we expect that to continue.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/12/livanova-livn-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LIVN 2026 Q2","e":"livn","d":"2026-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Vladimir Makatsaria","x":"Improved realized pricing in the second quarter was driven by reduced volume discounting in addition to our standard annual list price increase.","url":"ht